{
  "wireMagic": "pb3",
  "pens": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wsWinStyles": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wpWinPositions": [ {
  
  } ],
  "events": [ {
    "tStartMs": 199,
    "dDurationMs": 3421,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This spike we place right in next to the dorsal\nfin."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3620,
    "dDurationMs": 2319,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That is the pinger."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5939,
    "dDurationMs": 7240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e And you put it on that bone behind your\near."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 13179,
    "dDurationMs": 4601,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You can hear it pinging."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 17780,
    "dDurationMs": 1840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e Oh, man."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 19620,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 20620,
    "dDurationMs": 1610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It is quite high pitched."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 22230,
    "dDurationMs": 3850,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It sounds like a really high pitched bird\nchirping in your ear."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 26080,
    "dDurationMs": 5250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e The sound given off by the tag that will\non that a frequency of 69 kilohertz, but then"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 31330,
    "dDurationMs": 3680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "each tag has its own specific frequency space\nID."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 35010,
    "dDurationMs": 3470,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e So using underwater microphones you can\nhear when different sharks are nearby."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 38480,
    "dDurationMs": 3640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There is a little yellow buoy out there which\nactually has a little tracker on it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 42120,
    "dDurationMs": 2070,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So every time a tagged shark swims by..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 44190,
    "dDurationMs": 1210,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is like the shark not checking in."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 45400,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e Yes, it is."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 46400,
    "dDurationMs": 1440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It is like a shark checking in."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 47840,
    "dDurationMs": 5860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And over here {?} then it connects to a satellite."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 53700,
    "dDurationMs": 1240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e And it emails us, lets us know."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 54940,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e At home when the shark is here."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 55940,
    "dDurationMs": 4040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e And at the same time we also hope to get\na tissue sample from the shark that we tag."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 59980,
    "dDurationMs": 1750,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e Why is that important to grab a tissue\nsample?\u003e\u003e"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 61730,
    "dDurationMs": 5230,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A couple of studies we are doing are looking\nat the genetic populations of the different"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 66960,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "sharks of the world."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 67960,
    "dDurationMs": 4350,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Even in Australia we are finding they are\ntoo different than any populations."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 72310,
    "dDurationMs": 4259,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Also we can work out what the shark has been\neating recently by its tissue."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 76569,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e Wow."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 77569,
    "dDurationMs": 2550,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But before you can tag a shark you have to\nentice it close to the boat."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 80119,
    "dDurationMs": 3103,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well it is morning and we are just about to\nhave breakfast, but I thought I would come"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 83222,
    "dDurationMs": 3138,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "out and have a look at the shark’s breakfast."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 86360,
    "dDurationMs": 5410,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yeah, that is what we are going to be leaking\noverboard to attract the shark’s to our"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 91770,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "cages."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 92770,
    "dDurationMs": 3879,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We just threw the bait in and waited about\ntwo minutes and a shark came up and grabbed"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 96649,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 97649,
    "dDurationMs": 2180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I was trying to fill the seagulls around the\nbay when it hit."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 99829,
    "dDurationMs": 4830,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It was incredible, just unbelievable to see\nhow fast they arrived here."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 104659,
    "dDurationMs": 3561,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So the sharks are here and they are biting."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 108220,
    "dDurationMs": 4079,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The goal was not to feed the sharks, but to\npull the bait away from them before they can"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 112299,
    "dDurationMs": 2371,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "get it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 114670,
    "dDurationMs": 4280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh, man."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 118950,
    "dDurationMs": 4529,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That is a big shark."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 123479,
    "dDurationMs": 8081,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "As a storm rolled in, it was my chance to\nobserve the sharks on their own terms underwater."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 131560,
    "dDurationMs": 5550,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I am just trying to make a nice seal with\nmy mask so I don’t get any water in."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 137110,
    "dDurationMs": 2969,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That means heaps of Vaseline on my moustache."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 140079,
    "dDurationMs": 1121,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It feels disgusting."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 141200,
    "dDurationMs": 5170,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e Today we have got pretty stormy weather\nand the sharks are fired up a bit."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 146370,
    "dDurationMs": 1149,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is the whether that suits them for predation\nwith the sea lions."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 147519,
    "dDurationMs": 1601,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e I would say good for us."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 149120,
    "dDurationMs": 6740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We are all cold and wet, but yeah, good conditions\nfor the sharks."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 155860,
    "dDurationMs": 1040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "[ multiple voices ]"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 156900,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e This is gross."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 157900,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You are using like half the tub on me."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 158900,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e Yeah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 159900,
    "dDurationMs": 1949,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That is how it is going to be."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 161849,
    "dDurationMs": 1541,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e Thank you."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 163390,
    "dDurationMs": 12840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e There is a storm front coming through."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 176230,
    "dDurationMs": 16920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Sharks are fired up for you."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 193150,
    "dDurationMs": 5640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e Thank you."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 198790,
    "dDurationMs": 4970,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "From the cage you can see the sharks that\nhave already been tagged."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 203760,
    "dDurationMs": 9850,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And you get a different perspective on what\nit is like to pull food away from a shark’s"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 213610,
    "dDurationMs": 1989,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "mouth."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 215599,
    "dDurationMs": 3840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In real time you can see just how fast they\ncan strike."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 219439,
    "dDurationMs": 6621,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That was a pretty incredible surreal experience."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 226060,
    "dDurationMs": 3289,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You just drop in there and it is a whole other\nworld."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 229349,
    "dDurationMs": 4280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And it is funny, you don’t really feel scared\nof them, just, I don’t know, maybe it is"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 233629,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the cage."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 234629,
    "dDurationMs": 4250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But they just look so docile and peaceful."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 238879,
    "dDurationMs": 2431,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So hard is it to stick one of those in the\ndorsal fin?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 241310,
    "dDurationMs": 8340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e If I can get a shark in really close and\nget the right shot, they make it pretty easy"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 249650,
    "dDurationMs": 11660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "when they swim past the back of the boat."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 261310,
    "dDurationMs": 1620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The platform here."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 262930,
    "dDurationMs": 1620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e There it is."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 264550,
    "dDurationMs": 8620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e They have to be going slightly going away\nand they have to turn to present, so..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 273170,
    "dDurationMs": 1550,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e Come on."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 274720,
    "dDurationMs": 3120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Come on."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 277840,
    "dDurationMs": 1550,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 279390,
    "dDurationMs": 3110,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "With the light fading, tagging was put on\nhold until tomorrow."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 282500,
    "dDurationMs": 4950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And that gave me a chance to talk to the researchers\nabout why this research is so important."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 287450,
    "dDurationMs": 2280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e Before protection they were hunted for\nsport."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 289730,
    "dDurationMs": 5410,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They were hunted for their jaws and they are\nhunted just out of fear."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 295140,
    "dDurationMs": 1870,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e Everybody was scared of sharks."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 297010,
    "dDurationMs": 2020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e You know, the Jaws movie, the Jaws phenomenon."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 299030,
    "dDurationMs": 4200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It created an awful lot of fear of these animals."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 303230,
    "dDurationMs": 1330,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e Sharks were mindless killers."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 304560,
    "dDurationMs": 1860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e And people just wanted them out of the\nocean."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 306420,
    "dDurationMs": 2130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The population on has basically crashed."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 308550,
    "dDurationMs": 3160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e And this research is essential to help\ntheir numbers recover."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 311710,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e We have to find out how many sharks are\nout there."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 314110,
    "dDurationMs": 4200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We have to find out where they travel to,\nwhere they breed."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 318310,
    "dDurationMs": 2070,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That is one of the holy grails that no one\nknows."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 320380,
    "dDurationMs": 1060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Where do they give birth?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 321440,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We don’t know that either."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 322440,
    "dDurationMs": 1130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "No one has ever seen them breeding."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 323570,
    "dDurationMs": 1880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "No one has ever seen them giving birth."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 325450,
    "dDurationMs": 4910,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And if you can’t protect sharks in those\nkey areas, then you are not going to really"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 330360,
    "dDurationMs": 11500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "be able to have much of an impact across the\npopulation as a whole."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 341860,
    "dDurationMs": 20740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e That is great for science."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 362600,
    "dDurationMs": 23190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e You know, we be have begin to scratch the\nsurface with satellite tagging."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 385790,
    "dDurationMs": 2550,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We always thought white sharks were a coastal\nspecies."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 388340,
    "dDurationMs": 4130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We have found that they are able to do dives\nwell over a kilometer deep."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 392470,
    "dDurationMs": 3340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They frequently dive off of the edge of the\ncontinental shelf."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 395810,
    "dDurationMs": 4020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They go in and inhabit niches out in the open\nocean for months and months and months on"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 399830,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "end."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 400830,
    "dDurationMs": 4210,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So this whole myth that they are this coastal\ncreature has been completely debunked with"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 405040,
    "dDurationMs": 1550,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the advent of this new technology."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 406590,
    "dDurationMs": 6320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It is one of those things where these animals\nare... if you ask a question and you conduct"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 412910,
    "dDurationMs": 4280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "your research and you answer your question\nand then you have five more questions that"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 417190,
    "dDurationMs": 3810,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "have arisen from that answer, so that is...\nyeah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 421000,
    "dDurationMs": 6090,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There is obviously there is a lot more to\nlearn."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 427090,
    "dDurationMs": 4310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Veritasium is supported by Audible.com, a\nleading provider of audio books with over"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 431400,
    "dDurationMs": 5150,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "150,000 different titles in all areas of literature\nincluding fiction, non fiction and periodicals."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 436550,
    "dDurationMs": 5130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This week I wanted to recommend a book called\nGenius: The Life and Science of Richard Feynman"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 441680,
    "dDurationMs": 1090,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "by James Gleick."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 442770,
    "dDurationMs": 3190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He is one of my all time favorite authors,\nso you should really check it out."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 445960,
    "dDurationMs": 3220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In fact, you can download it for free by going\nto Audible.com/Veritasium."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 449180,
    "dDurationMs": 4380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Or you can pick any other book of your choice\nfor a one month free trial."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 453560,
    "dDurationMs": 2360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So thank you to Audible.com for supporting\nme."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 455920,
    "dDurationMs": 3771,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now if you don’t know, I also have a second\nchannel which is called 2Veritasium where"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 459691,
    "dDurationMs": 2729,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I post vlogs and my thoughts on the world."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 462420,
    "dDurationMs": 3390,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So if you want to check that out then you\ncan click on this link or the link in the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 465810,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "description."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 466810,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So thank you for watching."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 467810,
    "dDurationMs": 780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I will see you next time."
    } ]
  } ]
}
